 576:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****              * is a WARL field. The PLIC will mask all PLIC interrupts of a priority
 577:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****              * less than or equal to threshold. For example, a threshold value of zero
