 678:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  * The function PLIC_DisableIRQ() disables the external interrupt for the
 679:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  * interrupt number indicated by the parameter IRQn.
 680:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h **** 
 681:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  * NOTE:
 682:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  *     This function can be used to disable the external interrupt from outside
 683:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  *     external interrupt handler function.
 684:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  *     This function MUST NOT be used from within the External Interrupt
 685:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  *     handler.
 686:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  *     If you wish to disable the external interrupt while the interrupt handler
 687:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  *     for that external interrupt is executing then you must use the return
 688:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  *     value EXT_IRQ_DISABLE to return from the extern interrupt handler.
 689:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/../../../mpfs_hal/common/mss_plic.h ****  */
