 136:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/mss_i2c.c ****      * Initialize all items of the this_i2c data structure to zero. This
 137:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/mss_i2c.c ****      * initializes all state variables to their init value. It relies on
 138:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/mss_i2c.c ****      * the fact that NO_TRANSACTION, I2C_SUCCESS and I2C_RELEASE_BUS all
 139:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/mss_i2c.c ****      * have an actual value of zero.
 140:../src/platform/drivers/mss/mss_i2c/mss_i2c.c ****      */
